    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONE DAY'S SUNSET TIMELAPSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the same day as ever, I saw your death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And back to the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with award-winning cassette tapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I won't let you be like that.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I had the same dream. I woke up and it was a classroom, and I had a day like no other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There was no problem. I knew it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And I witnessed your death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was the classroom that opened my eyes again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, it was in the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RE : PIAN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ripian is an interactive story game based on the RPG MAKER MV. It has low degrees of freedom, but you just have to immerse yourself in the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play the game as the point of view of the main character, Kang Ji-um.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop the death of your friend Lee Jia and bring out a happy ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And find out the truth of the cassette tape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOTICE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ripian is a game created by the creative activities of the 2024 middle school student autonomous club Cheonji Creation,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We don't seek any financial profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hope you enjoy it,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and please be accept if you found the immature part.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have any questions such as bugs, please send the email.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GOOD LUCK</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONE DAY'S SUNSET TIMELAPSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the same day as ever, I saw your death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And back to the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with award-winning cassette tapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I won't let you be like that.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I had the same dream. I woke up and it was a classroom, and I had a day like no other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There was no problem. I knew it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And I witnessed your death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was the classroom that opened my eyes again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, it was in the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RE : PIAN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ripian is an interactive story game based on the RPG MAKER MV. It has low degrees of freedom, but you just have to immerse yourself in the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play the game as the point of view of the main character, Kang Ji-um.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop the death of your friend Lee Jia and bring out a happy ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And find out the truth of the cassette tape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOTICE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ripian is a game created by the creative activities of the 2024 middle school student autonomous club Cheonji Creation,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We don't seek any financial profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hope you enjoy it,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and please be accept if you found the immature part.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have any questions such as bugs, please send the email.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GOOD LUCK</p>",
